      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "I think this could be really important.\nThere is a certain user in VRchat who brings in their patients into VRchat with them sometimes and uses it for therapy. If I were in their shoes knowing that at least in private worlds everything said would actually be private, and not have to worry about eavesdropping by invisible mods would be great.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5a66401e4c46134c4acb185c",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5925d77c49fb6a3e127f8a61",
        "alias": "Amaranth Magpie",
        "aliasID": "65c3a94ced6eefce4c7d7730",
