      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "I can't think of a case where I've seen this to be an issue. But if it was and it was changed how can you be sure it is a rule that is being followed if they are invisible? I do agree being invisible period is creepy.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
