      "value": "@{58c6b8f8227a56787575ebc0|full_name}: I had a discussion with another world creator who wanted to be able to enter private instances of his world. I told him about the very same guy you have in mind and that it would not be nice to do that. Didn't even think about mods at this time. I have to agree, if mods enter private worlds they should not be invisible.",
